      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200076006F006900630069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un instant...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand tu auras trouvé la réponse, reviens me\nvoir avec le Pokémon en question.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors ? De quel Pokémon s’agit-il ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F007200730020003F0020004400650020007100750065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007320190061006700690074002D0069006C0020003F00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, montre-moi le bon Pokémon !\nTu vas bien finir par réussir à le trouver !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Désolée, ce n’est pas le bon...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E90073006F006C00E90065002C0020006300650020006E201900650073007400200070006100730020006C006500200062006F006E002E002E002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Némélios mâle ? Non, ce n’est pas lui...\nMais tu brûles ! C’est presque ça !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Némélios femelle...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
